<title>USA: Biopool gets product approvals in Japan.</title>
<headline>Biopool gets product approvals in Japan.</headline>
<dateline>VENTURA, Calif. 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Biopool International Inc said Thursday it received approval to market four additional products in Japan.</p>
<p>The products are monoclonal antibody-based reagents used in blood grouping and typing and in cross-matching for blood transfusions.</p>
<p>Biopool makes a range of test kits to assess and diagnose various health disorders, and detect the presence of drugs.</p>
</text>
